1
00:01:32,860 --> 00:01:34,990
[OVERDO]

2
00:01:35,400 --> 00:01:37,560
[Episode 29]

3
00:01:42,590 --> 00:01:43,070
Stop there!

4
00:01:43,070 --> 00:01:44,150
The government orders

5
00:01:44,150 --> 00:01:46,070
to search the train station immediately.

6
00:01:46,070 --> 00:01:47,200
The Marshal orders—

7
00:01:47,229 --> 00:01:48,350
no one is allowed
to enter the train station.

8
00:01:48,350 --> 00:01:49,590
Anyone who blocks us
will be punished by military law.

9
00:01:49,590 --> 00:01:50,280
Stop!

10
00:01:50,920 --> 00:01:51,560
Stop!

11
00:01:57,840 --> 00:01:59,500
Anyone who forces their way in

12
00:02:00,120 --> 00:02:01,400
will be shot on sight.

13
00:02:09,630 --> 00:02:11,760
Although the North-South Railway...

14
00:02:15,750 --> 00:02:17,750
is no longer managed by my Li family,

15
00:02:19,030 --> 00:02:20,960
Nancheng train station is still

16
00:02:21,710 --> 00:02:23,430
the Ying Army's station.

17
00:02:26,630 --> 00:02:27,490
Let me tell you,

18
00:02:28,150 --> 00:02:29,480
without my permission,

19
00:02:30,630 --> 00:02:31,240
you

20
00:02:31,800 --> 00:02:32,630
cannot enter.

21
00:02:33,630 --> 00:02:34,710
You can't take away

22
00:02:34,840 --> 00:02:36,300
the things inside either.

23
00:02:38,870 --> 00:02:40,190
Do you know what's inside?

24
00:02:40,190 --> 00:02:40,960
So what?

25
00:02:41,470 --> 00:02:42,190
The things inside

26
00:02:42,190 --> 00:02:44,030
can keep my father safe.

27
00:02:45,360 --> 00:02:46,960
When my father's not around,

28
00:02:47,560 --> 00:02:48,910
the entire Ying Army

29
00:02:49,800 --> 00:02:51,120
listens to my orders.

30
00:02:53,000 --> 00:02:54,730
If you want to force your way in,

31
00:02:55,590 --> 00:02:56,590
have a guess—

32
00:02:57,630 --> 00:03:00,030
would I dare to get serious with you?

33
00:03:12,870 --> 00:03:14,280
Li Boze, do you know

34
00:03:15,240 --> 00:03:16,910
that if that thing spreads,

35
00:03:17,430 --> 00:03:19,490
thousands of lives will be affected?

36
00:03:23,030 --> 00:03:25,360
Li Rongzhang is only under investigation
and detention right now.

37
00:03:25,360 --> 00:03:29,360
-As for which is more important—
-Of course my father is more important.

38
00:03:35,190 --> 00:03:35,710
Look!

39
00:03:36,240 --> 00:03:38,100
Look at that expression of yours.

40
00:03:40,240 --> 00:03:41,310
In your heart,

41
00:03:43,590 --> 00:03:46,050
anything can be more important
than family.

42
00:03:46,400 --> 00:03:48,560
That's why you can make
our mother sick with anger,

43
00:03:48,560 --> 00:03:50,120
be mad at our eldest sister,

44
00:03:50,240 --> 00:03:52,470
and ignore our father's life and death!

45
00:03:58,360 --> 00:03:59,420
But I'm different.

46
00:04:00,840 --> 00:04:01,910
To me,

47
00:04:03,590 --> 00:04:05,050
family is more important.

48
00:04:07,190 --> 00:04:07,910
That's why I've

49
00:04:07,910 --> 00:04:10,150
repeatedly let you do as you please.

50
00:04:12,870 --> 00:04:14,030
It's different now.

51
00:04:14,910 --> 00:04:17,390
Now that my father
is in a difficult position,

52
00:04:17,390 --> 00:04:19,720
I can't let you mess around.

53
00:04:34,290 --> 00:04:35,310
Or if you want to do anything,

54
00:04:35,310 --> 00:04:36,270
you can try.

55
00:04:42,630 --> 00:04:43,240
Fine.

56
00:04:45,070 --> 00:04:45,870
Li Boze,

57
00:04:47,120 --> 00:04:49,980
I don't have time to show off
my strength to you here.

58
00:04:51,750 --> 00:04:53,550
I can leave the Red Pills behind.

59
00:04:54,560 --> 00:04:55,560
But I must

60
00:04:55,680 --> 00:04:57,340
take that patient away today.

61
00:04:58,000 --> 00:04:59,800
He is the first infected person.

62
00:05:00,560 --> 00:05:03,240
The Ying Army has no experience
in dealing with this.

63
00:05:03,240 --> 00:05:04,310
If he stays

64
00:05:04,630 --> 00:05:06,230
and is not treated properly,

65
00:05:06,390 --> 00:05:08,250
it will only get everyone killed.

66
00:05:15,750 --> 00:05:16,750
Bring him out.

67
00:05:17,390 --> 00:05:17,920
Wait.

68
00:05:19,070 --> 00:05:20,120
Let my men in.

69
00:05:47,120 --> 00:05:49,630
I've already told you the dangers
of the Red Pill.

70
00:05:49,630 --> 00:05:50,630
You better know

71
00:05:50,750 --> 00:05:51,810
what you're doing.

72
00:06:26,150 --> 00:06:32,980
[Li Residence]

73
00:06:39,070 --> 00:06:39,720
Brother.

74
00:06:41,800 --> 00:06:43,680
You work for the government,

75
00:06:43,680 --> 00:06:45,680
and act as a dog for the Zhang family.

76
00:06:46,830 --> 00:06:48,120
Do you

77
00:06:48,830 --> 00:06:49,950
get double pay?

78
00:07:02,040 --> 00:07:02,970
Why are you here?

79
00:07:04,040 --> 00:07:04,680
Father.

80
00:07:15,600 --> 00:07:16,860
Rest assured, Father.

81
00:07:18,950 --> 00:07:20,000
The Ying Army is

82
00:07:21,310 --> 00:07:22,440
operating as usual.

83
00:07:23,830 --> 00:07:25,030
Don't worry too much.

84
00:07:28,120 --> 00:07:31,580
This place is full of people
who seem to be from the government,

85
00:07:32,870 --> 00:07:35,670
but are actually
the Zhang family's running dogs.

86
00:07:36,560 --> 00:07:38,560
You came in so openly...

87
00:07:40,240 --> 00:07:42,700
Did you use
the Zhang family's connections?

88
00:07:51,270 --> 00:07:51,870
Yes.

89
00:07:53,000 --> 00:07:54,800
I made a deal with Zhang Mingshu.

90
00:07:56,560 --> 00:07:57,620
Tomorrow morning,

91
00:07:58,000 --> 00:07:59,870
this batch of Red Pills will be sent away.

92
00:07:59,870 --> 00:08:00,730
In the evening,

93
00:08:01,160 --> 00:08:02,820
you will be reinstated
to your official position.

94
00:08:02,820 --> 00:08:03,750
Bastard!

95
00:08:06,800 --> 00:08:09,160
How could I give birth
to someone like you?

96
00:08:12,390 --> 00:08:14,070
Although I play dirty,

97
00:08:15,120 --> 00:08:17,190
I have never

98
00:08:17,190 --> 00:08:18,800
colluded with others

99
00:08:18,800 --> 00:08:20,360
to harm our compatriots.

100
00:08:20,720 --> 00:08:21,780
Do you understand?

101
00:08:21,920 --> 00:08:23,160
I don't want to know!

102
00:08:28,000 --> 00:08:30,460
It's not my place
to care about these things!

103
00:08:30,510 --> 00:08:31,630
All I need to do now

104
00:08:32,000 --> 00:08:33,440
is to protect you,

105
00:08:33,909 --> 00:08:35,390
and protect this family!

106
00:08:42,440 --> 00:08:45,440
You are the future commander
of the Ying Army!

107
00:08:45,440 --> 00:08:46,970
If you don't care, who will?

108
00:08:47,390 --> 00:08:50,250
If you don't care about this,
what do you care about?

109
00:08:51,000 --> 00:08:53,440
Is your head only full of petty romance?

110
00:08:56,440 --> 00:08:57,630
Worthless thing.

111
00:09:01,080 --> 00:09:02,440
Just like your mother.

112
00:09:03,440 --> 00:09:04,030
Trash!

113
00:09:04,240 --> 00:09:05,600
What I must do now

114
00:09:06,840 --> 00:09:08,720
is only to keep you safe.

115
00:09:09,390 --> 00:09:10,270
Why?

116
00:09:10,550 --> 00:09:12,670
Because I only have you left, Father.

117
00:09:15,120 --> 00:09:17,150
You are all I have now.

118
00:09:20,080 --> 00:09:20,960
Foolish.

119
00:09:23,240 --> 00:09:24,000
Foolish...

120
00:09:27,790 --> 00:09:28,440
Get out.

121
00:09:50,000 --> 00:09:50,670
Father.

122
00:09:54,240 --> 00:09:55,150
No matter what,

123
00:09:57,150 --> 00:09:59,030
I will protect you at all costs.

124
00:10:08,750 --> 00:10:09,870
You seem

125
00:10:10,720 --> 00:10:11,920
upset today, Father.

126
00:10:13,960 --> 00:10:14,870
Rest early.

127
00:10:34,610 --> 00:10:39,870
[Lanxin Theater]

128
00:10:38,670 --> 00:10:40,320
The train station changed guards at night.

129
00:10:40,320 --> 00:10:42,320
Now they are all Zhang family's men.

130
00:10:42,550 --> 00:10:45,810
Young Master Boze
is really going to send the Red Pills out.

131
00:10:45,960 --> 00:10:47,020
After Qingyu died,

132
00:10:48,270 --> 00:10:49,320
he lost his mind.

133
00:10:50,790 --> 00:10:52,910
Once this batch of Red Pills
leaves Nancheng,

134
00:10:52,910 --> 00:10:55,170
their whereabouts will be hard to track.

135
00:10:57,150 --> 00:10:57,960
So...

136
00:10:58,870 --> 00:11:00,730
before the Red Pills are sent out,

137
00:11:00,750 --> 00:11:02,280
we must dispose of them all.

138
00:11:04,030 --> 00:11:04,670
Tomorrow,

139
00:11:04,960 --> 00:11:07,160
our men will set up defenses in the city.

140
00:11:07,270 --> 00:11:09,030
As soon as the train leaves the station,

141
00:11:09,030 --> 00:11:10,360
blow it up immediately.

142
00:11:10,510 --> 00:11:12,960
We absolutely cannot let the Red Pills
leave the city.

143
00:11:12,960 --> 00:11:14,360
But we don't have enough men

144
00:11:14,360 --> 00:11:15,240
or explosives.

145
00:11:15,790 --> 00:11:17,670
Whether the train goes north or south,

146
00:11:17,670 --> 00:11:18,440
or which route it takes—

147
00:11:18,440 --> 00:11:19,510
we know nothing.

148
00:11:20,480 --> 00:11:21,240
I know.

149
00:11:30,080 --> 00:11:32,940
I know which route the Red Pills
will take tomorrow.

150
00:11:33,510 --> 00:11:34,270
Susu.

151
00:11:35,480 --> 00:11:36,440
How is Le'an?

152
00:11:36,910 --> 00:11:38,120
Was he scared?

153
00:11:40,150 --> 00:11:41,440
Kids are playful.

154
00:11:41,910 --> 00:11:45,040
Reading a storybook for a while
made him forget his fear.

155
00:11:47,720 --> 00:11:48,440
Susu.

156
00:11:49,510 --> 00:11:51,370
About what happened 19 years ago,

157
00:11:51,750 --> 00:11:52,390
I...

158
00:11:58,080 --> 00:11:59,080
Between us,

159
00:12:00,670 --> 00:12:03,750
it's been hard to tell
who's right or wrong for a while now.

160
00:12:03,750 --> 00:12:04,880
At the end of the day,

161
00:12:07,270 --> 00:12:09,470
we should both apologize to each other.

162
00:12:13,200 --> 00:12:14,870
The most important thing right now

163
00:12:14,870 --> 00:12:16,670
is to investigate the Red Pills.

164
00:12:16,750 --> 00:12:18,750
I'll let you know if I hear anything.

165
00:12:21,070 --> 00:12:22,460
Zhang Mingshu has a concubine

166
00:12:22,460 --> 00:12:24,460
who came from the Renxin Orphanage.

167
00:12:25,600 --> 00:12:27,270
She secretly sent someone to inform me.

168
00:12:27,270 --> 00:12:33,070
[Nancheng Station] [Jiating Station]
[Qingqu Station] [Zhanan Station]

169
00:12:27,720 --> 00:12:28,790
Tomorrow at 3 PM,

170
00:12:29,030 --> 00:12:30,630
a train loaded with Red Pills

171
00:12:30,720 --> 00:12:32,550
will depart along this railway.

172
00:12:34,540 --> 00:12:36,540
The source is absolutely reliable.

173
00:12:41,150 --> 00:12:43,680
This batch of Red Pills
is highly contagious.

174
00:12:43,960 --> 00:12:44,600
So,

175
00:12:45,080 --> 00:12:46,120
we absolutely cannot let this cargo

176
00:12:46,120 --> 00:12:48,320
fall into the hands of the Zhang family.

177
00:12:49,600 --> 00:12:51,730
So this batch of Red Pills is infected.

178
00:12:54,480 --> 00:12:55,680
What's your plan now?

179
00:12:58,910 --> 00:13:00,110
Tomorrow, our people

180
00:13:00,120 --> 00:13:02,000
will set up defenses in the suburbs.

181
00:13:02,000 --> 00:13:03,860
We'll blow up the train directly.

182
00:13:05,240 --> 00:13:05,970
Who's going?

183
00:13:08,110 --> 00:13:09,270
You and Ms. Ye go.

184
00:13:09,630 --> 00:13:12,560
I will leave the people
at the aviation school to you.

185
00:13:12,790 --> 00:13:13,750
Okay.

186
00:13:14,580 --> 00:13:15,440
What about you?

187
00:13:17,000 --> 00:13:18,800
I have to go to the train station.

188
00:13:18,960 --> 00:13:20,960
I can't let Li Boze get on that train.

189
00:13:21,790 --> 00:13:22,550
Besides,

190
00:13:23,240 --> 00:13:25,010
I'm the one the Zhang family is targeting.

191
00:13:25,010 --> 00:13:26,120
If I stay at the station

192
00:13:26,120 --> 00:13:27,400
under their noses,

193
00:13:27,420 --> 00:13:28,550
they can be relaxed.

194
00:13:38,590 --> 00:13:39,850
I'll go check on Le'an.

195
00:13:48,240 --> 00:13:49,970
According to our current plan,

196
00:13:50,550 --> 00:13:52,550
the Red Pills should be exploded
as soon as they leave the station.

197
00:13:52,550 --> 00:13:54,670
They won't even make it out of the city.

198
00:13:54,670 --> 00:13:56,800
Why are you sending her and Ms. Ye away?

199
00:13:57,270 --> 00:13:58,600
Nancheng is in danger.

200
00:13:58,750 --> 00:14:00,630
I can't let them take risks.

201
00:14:02,610 --> 00:14:04,480
The Pan-East Asia Chamber of Commerce
behind the Zhang family

202
00:14:04,480 --> 00:14:05,390
is the vanguard

203
00:14:05,550 --> 00:14:07,750
using trade activities to lead the way.

204
00:14:08,240 --> 00:14:09,720
Their intentions are unpredictable.

205
00:14:09,720 --> 00:14:11,550
Now the northern battlefield
has been lost,

206
00:14:11,550 --> 00:14:13,480
even the higher-ups can't suppress them.

207
00:14:13,480 --> 00:14:14,120
Me,

208
00:14:14,840 --> 00:14:15,600
Li Boze,

209
00:14:15,840 --> 00:14:16,840
and Li Rongzhang—

210
00:14:18,120 --> 00:14:21,240
who among us will become
the first innocent soul under their guns?

211
00:14:21,240 --> 00:14:22,240
Nobody knows.

212
00:14:22,240 --> 00:14:23,390
Then why are you still going?

213
00:14:23,390 --> 00:14:26,790
-The train station is full of their—
-Someone has to stand up.

214
00:14:40,410 --> 00:14:45,290
[Nancheng Station] [Jiating Station]
[Qingqu Station] [Zhanan Station]

215
00:15:22,960 --> 00:15:25,000
What are they singing?

216
00:15:27,790 --> 00:15:29,320
I'm here all day long,

217
00:15:29,320 --> 00:15:30,750
eating and sleeping.

218
00:15:30,750 --> 00:15:32,080
It's so suffocating.

219
00:15:32,630 --> 00:15:34,430
Do they think I'm made of cotton?

220
00:15:37,120 --> 00:15:38,360
I'm being investigated,

221
00:15:38,360 --> 00:15:39,390
not imprisoned.

222
00:15:40,080 --> 00:15:41,750
If you make me uncomfortable,

223
00:15:43,150 --> 00:15:44,680
none of you will have peace.

224
00:15:46,360 --> 00:15:47,670
Go tell your master

225
00:15:47,910 --> 00:15:50,240
to get someone who can relieve my boredom.

226
00:15:54,630 --> 00:15:56,240
Get Hai Tangqing for me.

227
00:15:58,960 --> 00:15:59,840
Go!

228
00:16:00,630 --> 00:16:01,360
Understood.

229
00:16:19,760 --> 00:16:23,270
[Nancheng Station]

230
00:16:21,000 --> 00:16:22,390
The Young Marshal has ordered

231
00:16:22,390 --> 00:16:23,450
a change of guards.

232
00:16:23,630 --> 00:16:24,240
Return!

233
00:16:33,950 --> 00:16:36,190
[Station entrance] [Station Exit]

234
00:16:42,290 --> 00:16:45,450
[Nancheng Station]

235
00:16:55,790 --> 00:16:56,550
Marshal,

236
00:16:56,720 --> 00:16:57,910
I brought her here.

237
00:16:57,910 --> 00:16:59,750
Are you satisfied?

238
00:17:08,790 --> 00:17:10,440
Rest assured, Marshal.

239
00:17:10,589 --> 00:17:12,680
We've already warned her.

240
00:17:12,920 --> 00:17:14,640
She'll leave right after singing.

241
00:17:14,640 --> 00:17:15,349
After all,

242
00:17:15,480 --> 00:17:17,589
Boss Hai sings your favorite Liang Hongyu

243
00:17:17,589 --> 00:17:19,680
the best.

244
00:17:21,750 --> 00:17:22,810
All of you, get out.

245
00:17:36,880 --> 00:17:37,940
Cooperate with me.

246
00:18:25,720 --> 00:18:27,240
Thank you for escorting the cargo

247
00:18:27,240 --> 00:18:29,000
and making this trip personally.

248
00:18:29,000 --> 00:18:30,400
Young Master Mingshu said

249
00:18:30,400 --> 00:18:32,110
as soon as the train leaves Nancheng,

250
00:18:32,110 --> 00:18:33,830
the letter proving Marshal Li's innocence

251
00:18:33,830 --> 00:18:34,790
will be delivered.

252
00:18:34,790 --> 00:18:35,590
Li Boze!

253
00:18:55,390 --> 00:18:57,840
[Nancheng Station]

254
00:19:04,920 --> 00:19:05,590
What?

255
00:19:07,110 --> 00:19:08,840
Trying to snatch the Red Pills?

256
00:19:09,350 --> 00:19:10,950
These few men aren't enough.

257
00:19:14,880 --> 00:19:16,410
I'll tell you one last time:

258
00:19:17,480 --> 00:19:19,830
if this batch of Red Pills
leaves Nancheng,

259
00:19:19,830 --> 00:19:21,230
there is no turning back.

260
00:19:21,550 --> 00:19:22,830
I am the chief judge of the Red Pill case.

261
00:19:22,830 --> 00:19:23,690
If Li Rongzhang

262
00:19:23,830 --> 00:19:25,110
is truly innocent,

263
00:19:25,310 --> 00:19:26,550
I can defend him.

264
00:19:27,270 --> 00:19:28,070
Defend him?

265
00:19:29,000 --> 00:19:30,640
Why are you pretending
to be a good person now?

266
00:19:30,640 --> 00:19:31,480
It's too late.

267
00:19:31,960 --> 00:19:33,490
But I truly understand now—

268
00:19:33,510 --> 00:19:35,110
blood is thicker than water.

269
00:19:35,640 --> 00:19:37,040
At least, no matter what,

270
00:19:37,640 --> 00:19:39,640
Li Rongzhang will never abandon me.

271
00:20:20,590 --> 00:20:25,310
[Nancheng Station]

272
00:20:34,000 --> 00:20:35,750
The station is full of Zhang's men.

273
00:20:35,750 --> 00:20:36,310
Please

274
00:20:36,590 --> 00:20:37,480
be careful.

275
00:20:40,440 --> 00:20:42,510
You've fought alongside me
for half my life.

276
00:20:42,510 --> 00:20:44,070
You old comrades

277
00:20:44,400 --> 00:20:46,270
should have been generals by now.

278
00:20:48,510 --> 00:20:51,240
It's unfair to have you
pulling a rickshaw for me.

279
00:20:51,400 --> 00:20:53,960
I was always meant
to pull the Marshal's rickshaw.

280
00:20:53,960 --> 00:20:55,290
I've done it all my life.

281
00:20:55,590 --> 00:20:56,680
This can be considered

282
00:20:56,680 --> 00:20:58,540
seeing things through to the end.

283
00:20:59,270 --> 00:21:00,400
You old man.

284
00:21:00,550 --> 00:21:02,270
You still speak so bluntly.

285
00:21:06,680 --> 00:21:07,270
Marshal,

286
00:21:07,720 --> 00:21:08,980
let me go in your stead.

287
00:21:10,880 --> 00:21:12,000
Some things,

288
00:21:13,480 --> 00:21:15,160
I must handle myself.

289
00:21:31,750 --> 00:21:33,480
How do you want me to cooperate?

290
00:21:33,920 --> 00:21:35,240
I know you had a younger brother

291
00:21:35,240 --> 00:21:36,550
who, 19 years ago,

292
00:21:37,000 --> 00:21:38,790
was killed in an explosion.

293
00:21:39,550 --> 00:21:40,830
Your true enemy

294
00:21:42,880 --> 00:21:44,480
is the one who imprisoned me.

295
00:21:45,920 --> 00:21:47,550
The railway explosion back then

296
00:21:47,550 --> 00:21:49,680
was orchestrated by the Zhang family.

297
00:21:50,440 --> 00:21:53,100
The Red Pill matter
cannot wait a single moment.

298
00:21:55,480 --> 00:21:57,680
I've run the Ying Army for so many years.

299
00:21:58,000 --> 00:22:00,000
Only I know certain places.

300
00:22:01,270 --> 00:22:02,400
And some things,

301
00:22:02,880 --> 00:22:04,270
only I can use.

302
00:22:07,160 --> 00:22:08,350
I still have a few

303
00:22:09,380 --> 00:22:11,400
old comrades from the early days

304
00:22:12,030 --> 00:22:13,720
waiting for me at the station.

305
00:22:20,160 --> 00:22:21,550
What's with that look?

306
00:22:23,270 --> 00:22:24,350
I might not die.

307
00:22:25,400 --> 00:22:26,550
Even if I do,

308
00:22:27,680 --> 00:22:29,540
isn't that exactly what you want?

309
00:22:29,640 --> 00:22:31,170
You will leave here safely.

310
00:22:35,200 --> 00:22:35,790
Wait!

311
00:22:37,400 --> 00:22:39,590
Why is it that the several times
I tried to assassinate you,

312
00:22:39,590 --> 00:22:40,640
you let me go?

313
00:22:47,960 --> 00:22:48,920
I once misunderstood

314
00:22:48,920 --> 00:22:50,720
the mother of those two brats.

315
00:22:51,200 --> 00:22:52,800
She hated me for half her life

316
00:22:54,270 --> 00:22:55,800
and died leaving me behind.

317
00:22:57,720 --> 00:22:59,510
There's really nothing to explain.

318
00:22:59,510 --> 00:23:00,440
I owe her this.

319
00:23:01,960 --> 00:23:04,560
I will go down
and apologize to her personally.

320
00:23:05,270 --> 00:23:06,310
You're lucky.

321
00:23:07,720 --> 00:23:09,120
Your eyes look like hers.

322
00:23:21,390 --> 00:23:23,230
[Nancheng Station]

323
00:23:22,310 --> 00:23:23,110
Li Boze,

324
00:23:23,590 --> 00:23:25,270
do you know what you're doing?

325
00:23:25,640 --> 00:23:27,550
Think about it—what you're doing now,

326
00:23:27,550 --> 00:23:30,750
does it do justice to Qingyu
and your father's teachings?

327
00:23:37,720 --> 00:23:40,380
Qingyu might not have done justice
to me either!

328
00:23:46,510 --> 00:23:47,070
Laiyi.

329
00:23:57,160 --> 00:23:58,110
What do you mean?

330
00:23:59,070 --> 00:24:00,110
Don't you know?

331
00:24:01,830 --> 00:24:04,690
Qingyu always knew
about the Red Pill's existence.

332
00:24:05,270 --> 00:24:07,870
He had been
secretly investigating my father.

333
00:24:08,110 --> 00:24:10,240
Even at his wedding,

334
00:24:10,920 --> 00:24:14,050
he conspired with his fiancée
to assassinate my father.

335
00:24:14,480 --> 00:24:15,160
You didn't know

336
00:24:15,160 --> 00:24:16,290
any of this, did you?

337
00:24:18,030 --> 00:24:18,960
Miss Fang,

338
00:24:19,160 --> 00:24:20,240
have you seen this?

339
00:24:23,220 --> 00:24:25,400
I found it in the wedding hall.

340
00:24:28,920 --> 00:24:31,000
If an unexpected event
hadn't happened on that wedding day,

341
00:24:31,000 --> 00:24:32,640
my father would have died long ago.

342
00:24:32,640 --> 00:24:35,100
Yet I naively protected
this family for him,

343
00:24:35,830 --> 00:24:38,200
taking care of his fiancée and your child.

344
00:24:39,080 --> 00:24:40,110
With everything he did,

345
00:24:40,110 --> 00:24:41,770
do you think he did right by me?

346
00:24:43,640 --> 00:24:44,830
He never considered me

347
00:24:44,830 --> 00:24:46,440
in the slightest.

348
00:24:47,350 --> 00:24:49,270
I say he was a hypocrite,

349
00:24:49,510 --> 00:24:51,090
and deserved to die a tragic death!

350
00:24:51,090 --> 00:24:51,960
Say that again!

351
00:24:51,960 --> 00:24:52,590
What?

352
00:24:52,750 --> 00:24:54,270
I said he deserves a tragic death!

353
00:24:54,270 --> 00:24:54,960
So what?

354
00:24:55,030 --> 00:24:57,230
Are you trying to act tough with me here?

355
00:25:23,200 --> 00:25:24,480
Fine, Li Boze.

356
00:25:25,720 --> 00:25:27,000
I always thought

357
00:25:28,110 --> 00:25:30,440
that guns shouldn't be pointed at family.

358
00:25:31,920 --> 00:25:32,920
You're bold.

359
00:25:37,030 --> 00:25:37,590
Come on.

360
00:25:39,640 --> 00:25:41,040
If you have what it takes,

361
00:25:41,400 --> 00:25:42,880
shoot and kill me today!

362
00:25:45,110 --> 00:25:46,040
Second Brother.

363
00:26:11,830 --> 00:26:12,880
How ridiculous.

364
00:26:13,480 --> 00:26:15,680
The first time I hear you call me brother

365
00:26:15,720 --> 00:26:17,850
is when you're forcing me to shoot you.

366
00:26:22,750 --> 00:26:23,960
If it were in the past,

367
00:26:25,100 --> 00:26:26,240
for this "Brother,"

368
00:26:27,510 --> 00:26:29,310
I would do anything for you.

369
00:26:32,080 --> 00:26:33,240
But now...

370
00:26:52,250 --> 00:26:52,920
[Nancheng Station]

371
00:26:59,670 --> 00:27:00,700
[Nancheng Station]

372
00:27:10,640 --> 00:27:11,680
Farewell,

373
00:27:12,510 --> 00:27:13,720
Marshall Li.

374
00:27:22,830 --> 00:27:26,580
[Nancheng Station]

375
00:27:33,110 --> 00:27:33,840
The pills...

376
00:27:34,420 --> 00:27:35,200
My pills!

377
00:27:55,200 --> 00:27:57,270
I know about you and that brat.

378
00:27:58,960 --> 00:28:01,510
If you two really end up together,

379
00:28:07,000 --> 00:28:09,000
consider this an early gift from me.

380
00:28:10,000 --> 00:28:10,680
Take it.

381
00:28:17,350 --> 00:28:20,210
This was the token of love
between his mother and me.

382
00:28:21,680 --> 00:28:23,110
If I don't come back,

383
00:28:24,270 --> 00:28:26,130
please help me persuade that boy.

384
00:28:35,140 --> 00:28:38,250
♪ This spark of wildfire
spreading across the plains ♪

385
00:28:38,520 --> 00:28:41,880
♪ Stirs embers that refuse to fade ♪

386
00:28:39,550 --> 00:28:41,110
Persuade him not to

387
00:28:42,200 --> 00:28:43,720
abandon his ideals because of me,

388
00:28:42,270 --> 00:28:45,830
♪ I seize fate by the hand ♪

389
00:28:45,440 --> 00:28:48,070
to uphold the nation's dignity
and know right from wrong,

390
00:28:45,860 --> 00:28:49,010
♪ Accusing it of refusing to relent ♪

391
00:28:49,390 --> 00:28:52,870
♪ Pain and joy blur before my eyes ♪

392
00:28:49,400 --> 00:28:51,240
to not help the wicked,

393
00:28:51,750 --> 00:28:53,310
and to return to the right path soon.

394
00:28:53,090 --> 00:28:56,730
♪ Fate keeps replaying its endless cycle ♪

395
00:28:56,750 --> 00:29:02,350
♪ The love that refused to die ♪

396
00:29:03,600 --> 00:29:07,260
♪ Has already consumed us both ♪

397
00:29:19,400 --> 00:29:20,160
Help them!

398
00:29:20,480 --> 00:29:21,160
Hurry!

399
00:29:24,400 --> 00:29:25,730
Where is the principal?

400
00:29:26,070 --> 00:29:27,000
Where is Qingyi?

401
00:29:27,200 --> 00:29:28,460
Seems to be over there.

402
00:29:35,750 --> 00:29:36,510
Stay safe.

403
00:29:40,160 --> 00:29:40,790
Qingyi!

404
00:29:43,400 --> 00:29:44,160
How are you?

405
00:29:44,440 --> 00:29:45,370
Are you alright?

406
00:29:45,690 --> 00:29:46,550
I'm fine.

407
00:29:58,790 --> 00:30:00,190
Le'an is waiting for you.

408
00:30:07,720 --> 00:30:09,180
I miss Le'an very much too.

409
00:30:11,830 --> 00:30:12,750
And I miss...

410
00:30:37,240 --> 00:30:38,440
Li Rongzhang is dead.

411
00:30:40,000 --> 00:30:40,880
Li Rongzhang?

412
00:30:42,310 --> 00:30:43,750
He detonated the black powder

413
00:30:43,750 --> 00:30:46,480
that the Ying Army
hid in the underground tunnel.

414
00:30:47,240 --> 00:30:49,170
I need to visit the Li family later.

415
00:30:49,220 --> 00:30:50,030
After all,

416
00:30:50,920 --> 00:30:52,160
he is also my father.

417
00:30:55,270 --> 00:30:55,960
Go ahead.

418
00:30:56,720 --> 00:30:58,180
We'll handle things here.

419
00:31:10,530 --> 00:31:14,340
[Li Residence]

420
00:31:15,350 --> 00:31:16,270
What should we do?

421
00:31:16,270 --> 00:31:16,830
Exactly.

422
00:31:16,960 --> 00:31:17,680
Yeah.

423
00:31:18,200 --> 00:31:19,070
We are leaderless.

424
00:31:19,070 --> 00:31:19,720
Enough.

425
00:31:20,590 --> 00:31:21,990
Complaining won't help.

426
00:31:22,240 --> 00:31:23,030
I say,

427
00:31:23,310 --> 00:31:24,400
let's fight them.

428
00:31:24,590 --> 00:31:25,110
Right.

429
00:31:25,310 --> 00:31:27,350
I won't take their crap!

430
00:31:27,590 --> 00:31:28,520
For the Marshal,

431
00:31:29,200 --> 00:31:30,550
I'll risk my old life.

432
00:31:30,790 --> 00:31:32,110
This is too much.

433
00:31:32,350 --> 00:31:33,210
Young Marshal,

434
00:31:33,640 --> 00:31:34,770
just give the order.

435
00:31:46,070 --> 00:31:47,130
We hold the funeral

436
00:31:47,510 --> 00:31:49,640
and handle my father's affairs first.

437
00:31:51,830 --> 00:31:53,640
My father fought all his life,

438
00:31:54,350 --> 00:31:56,080
but was wronged before he died.

439
00:31:57,550 --> 00:31:58,480
After his death,

440
00:32:00,480 --> 00:32:02,070
we can't panic

441
00:32:03,130 --> 00:32:04,550
and ruin his reputation.

442
00:32:13,110 --> 00:32:13,830
Uncle Tang.

443
00:32:15,440 --> 00:32:16,160
Uncle Zhou.

444
00:32:17,160 --> 00:32:18,960
You are my father's old comrades

445
00:32:19,310 --> 00:32:20,240
and old friends.

446
00:32:20,720 --> 00:32:22,250
Although my father is gone,

447
00:32:25,160 --> 00:32:26,350
the Ying Army

448
00:32:28,030 --> 00:32:29,090
cannot be in chaos.

449
00:32:32,110 --> 00:32:32,720
Boze,

450
00:32:33,680 --> 00:32:34,680
with us here,

451
00:32:35,000 --> 00:32:35,920
rest assured.

452
00:32:36,240 --> 00:32:37,240
The Ying Army

453
00:32:37,830 --> 00:32:39,350
only listens to the Li family.

454
00:32:39,350 --> 00:32:40,160
-Yes.
-Yes.

455
00:32:40,160 --> 00:32:42,220
-We'll listen to the Li family.
-Yes.

456
00:32:45,920 --> 00:32:47,120
Please go back first.

457
00:32:53,880 --> 00:32:54,510
Boze.

458
00:32:55,920 --> 00:32:56,850
My condolences.

459
00:33:45,920 --> 00:33:46,960
You brat.

460
00:33:51,270 --> 00:33:52,750
Hiding alcohol now?

461
00:33:55,720 --> 00:33:56,240
Come.

462
00:33:57,000 --> 00:33:58,130
Have a drink with me.

463
00:34:07,510 --> 00:34:08,880
Remember:

464
00:34:09,320 --> 00:34:10,719
if there's good alcohol,

465
00:34:11,030 --> 00:34:12,440
let me drink it first.

466
00:34:12,960 --> 00:34:14,230
No hiding alcohol.

467
00:34:14,920 --> 00:34:15,630
Sure.

468
00:34:17,000 --> 00:34:17,510
Come.
